    "detailed_description": "<i>&quot;You know, what surprised me most, was not that they went that far with genetic mutations. Or, that somehow this god-knows-what strain popped out in somebody\u2019s system and started spreading. Nah, that\u2019s child\u2019s play compared to their crazy plan. <br><br>They tried to hide it. You think I\u2019m joking, right? I wish I was. <br><br>Truth is, they never stood a chance. We never stood a chance.&quot;</i><br><br><br>Fovos is a post-apocalyptic horror, rail shooter for the HTC Vive, set in a future where an omnipotent AI is taking over human brains through genetic implants. Even if you survive, will there be anything left to live with?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story-driven Single Player Campaign<br></li><li>Survival mode - Fight against hordes of incoming zombies to rock the leaderboards (leaderboard integration coming soon)</li></ul>",
